  data: {
    LLM: "Follow the 'Basic Strategy' chart: always hit on 11 or less, always stand on hard 17 or more. Stand on 12-16 if the dealer shows a 2-6 (bust cards).\n\nDouble Down Timing: Always double down on a total of 11 unless the dealer shows an Ace. Double on 10 against a dealer 2-9.\n\nCard Counting: Use the Hi-Lo system to track the ratio of high cards (10s, Aces) to low cards. Increase your bet when the 'True Count' is positive, as this increases the probability of a player blackjack.",
    Player: "Follow the 'Basic Strategy' chart: always hit on 11 or less, always stand on hard 17 or more. Stand on 12-16 if the dealer shows a 2-6 (bust cards).\n\nDouble Down Timing: Always double down on a total of 11 unless the dealer shows an Ace. Double on 10 against a dealer 2-9.\n\nCard Counting: Use the Hi-Lo system to track the ratio of high cards (10s, Aces) to low cards. Increase your bet when the 'True Count' is positive, as this increases the probability of a player blackjack.",
